      <span class="eyebrow">About Victoria</span>
      <h1>Ten years reading people. <em>Now I teach founders.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Before Take the Leap, I spent 10 years as a police officer, the last few as a detective. That work shaped everything about how I communicate today.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="photo">
      <img src="/images/purpose-and-passion-launch.jpg" alt="Victoria smiling, holding a copy of Purpose and Passion" width="915" height="1000" fetchpriority="high">
