<section class="section tight">
  <div class="wrap story">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The short version</span>
      <p class="big">It's about helping people back themselves.</p>
      <div class="copy">
        <p>Policing taught me how people respond under pressure, how much clarity and trust matter when the stakes are real, and how the way you deliver a message can change the outcome. In an interview room or an investor pitch, it's the same skill.</p>
        <p>Since leaving policing I've built a business from the ground up, secured a $100,000 grant and sat on boards and committees in my community. <strong>I'm not coaching from theory. I've done the thing I now help other people do.</strong></p>
        <p>My style is direct. I'll ask what you're actually trying to say and why anyone should care, and I'll tell you when something doesn't make sense. Then we fix it together, and where I can, I show you how to do it yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ol class="path" aria-label="Timeline">
      <li><span class="when">2013 – 2023</span><h3>Police officer, then detective, UK</h3><p>10 years in the police, the last few as a detective, learning how people communicate under pressure and how trust and clarity change outcomes.</p></li>
      <li><span class="when">Founder</span><h3>South West Snails</h3><p>Marketing, sales, pricing, branding, operations and compliance, all learned first-hand. $100,000 grant.</p></li>
      <li><span class="when">Community</span><h3>Boards &amp; committees</h3><p>Board member, Southern Forests Food Council. President and Secretary, Manjimup Chamber of Commerce.</p></li>
      <li><span class="when">2024</span><h3>Curtin Ignition scholarship</h3><p>Accelerator participant, known around the room as "the Snail Lady".</p></li>
      <li><span class="when">Ongoing</span><h3>Mentor</h3><p>Plus Eight programs with the Cities of Perth, Canning and Joondalup, and an Innovation Shed mentor.</p></li>
      <li><span class="when">Today</span><h3>Founder, Take the Leap</h3><p>Speaker, pitch masterclass facilitator and practical support for founders. Women in Business Award winner.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

